<title>SWEDEN: VOLVO UNIT BUYS DUTCH IMPORTER.</title>
<headline>VOLVO UNIT BUYS DUTCH IMPORTER.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo's marine engineering unit Penta said it signed a letter of agreement with Bloemsma Holdings BV to purchase Netherlands-based independent importer and distributor Nebim Handelmaatschappij.</p>
</text>
